sequenceDiagram
  actor Operator
  participant Web as RouteSure Web
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Adapter as NIPOST Adapter
  participant NIPOST as NIPOST API
  Operator->>Web: Enter address/postcode query
  Web->>API: GET /v1/search/autocomplete?q=...
  API->>Adapter: Validate and forward query
  Adapter->>NIPOST: Provider request with server-side key
  NIPOST-->>Adapter: Provider response
  Adapter-->>API: Parsed JSON or provider error
  API-->>Web: Result / mapped error
  Web-->>Operator: Show provider-backed data and confidence
